  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.WeaviateOASIS v2.0.2\n\nWeaviate OASIS Provider — vector + graph hybrid database for semantic search and knowledge graphs over OASIS holons and avatars via Weaviate REST API. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.1\n- Automate coordinated OASIS platform releases (7ed2053)\n- docs(packages): add missing NuGet guides and release setup sections (77c65ea)\n- feat(providers): add 11 analytical and RESP-compatible storage providers (161 total) (d2eedce)\n- Fix remaining integration and coverage failures (d8a5553)\n- fix: put every project in a solution and fix the bugs that exposed (4612aa0)\n- fix(packaging): explicitly include newly documented package readmes (5be30be)\n- Restore clean provider builds and integration startup (be39ecd)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.WeaviateOASIS",
